PARTS ADAPTED FROM OTHER PROJECTS

Where Female Gender Mod's breasts sit on the mod's own figures and how they bounce is
adapted from Female Gender Mod (WildfireRomeo, celeste, pupnewfster and its
contributors, https://github.com/FemaleGenderMod/FemaleGenderMod), version 5.0.0,
under the GNU LGPL 3.0: src/client/java/com/mopicmp/mosaicary/client/compat/GenderFigure.java.


WHAT IS NOT COVERED

The jar includes TwelveMonkeys ImageIO, which stays under its own BSD licence
(licenses/twelvemonkeys). The jars for Java 8 include classes from JvmDowngrader,
under the LGPL 2.1 (licenses/jvmdowngrader).

The interface icons are Lucide, under the ISC licence; its notice is in
src/client/resources/assets/mosaicary/textures/gui/icons.txt and ships in the jar.

The hat on the mod's icon is "Fancy Hat [ minecraft style ]" by LepikGem,
https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/fancy-hat-minecraft-style-b0f3fade197b44119939bd324c944a7a
under CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ . It was put on the
author's own model and rendered as the icon. That licence, not this one, covers the hat.

Skins in the catalogue belong to their authors and are not part of this licence.

